  "entries": [
    {
      "ordinal": 0,
      "label": "s1_sub_010_ecology_01",
      "hash64": "77F2E874C0CC2E21",
      "text": "[VAR 0x0100(0000)]! Wie geht’s, wie steht’s?[VAR 0x0114(002A)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 0,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0100",
          "args_hex": [
            "0000"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 30,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "002A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 1,
      "label": "s1_sub_010_ecology_02",
      "hash64": "77F2E574C0CC2908",
      "text": "Du haaast... [VAR 0x0202(0001)] Pokémon-Art[VAR 0x1101(0001,0200)]en aus der\\nKitakami-Provinz gefangen.[VAR 0x0114(002A)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 13,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0202",
          "args_hex": [
            "0001"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 29,
          "count": 3,
          "code_hex": "1101",
          "args_hex": [
            "0001",
            "0200"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 71,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "002A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 2,
      "label": "s1_sub_010_ecology_03",
      "hash64": "77F2E674C0CC2ABB",
      "text": "Die Exkursion hat gerade erst begonnen!\\c\\nVersuche, noch viiielen Pokémon zu begegnen,\\ndie es nur in Kitakami gibt![VAR 0x0114(002A)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 39,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 116,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "002A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 3,
      "label": "s1_sub_010_ecology_04",
      "hash64": "77F2EB74C0CC333A",
      "text": "In einem anderen Klima leben natürlich auch ganz\\nandere Pokémon.\\c\\nDie Sommer in Kitakami sind sehr schwül,\\nalso gibt es hier viele Pokémon, die hohe\\r\\nLuftfeuchtigkeit lieben.[VAR 0x0114(002A)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 64,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 150,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 178,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "002A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 4,
      "label": "s1_sub_010_ecology_05",
      "hash64": "77F2EC74C0CC34ED",
      "text": "Angeblich soll in den Höhen des Oniyama aus\\nder Erde vulkanisches Gas austreten!\\c\\nDas klingt so, als wäre es dort richtig gemütlich\\nfür Pokémon, die Gas gernhaben...[VAR 0x0114(002A)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 80,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 167,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "002A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 5,
      "label": "s1_sub_010_ecology_05_02",
      "hash64": "CC6D265DB8C2E240",
      "text": "Aber pass du lieber auf, dass du nicht zu viel\\ndavon einatmest, [VAR 0x0100(0000)].[VAR 0x0114(002A)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 64,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0100",
          "args_hex": [
            "0000"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 69,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "002A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 6,
      "label": "s1_sub_010_ecology_06",
      "hash64": "77F2E974C0CC2FD4",
      "text": "Wooow! Du hast ja fast den ganzen\\nKitakami-Pokédex vervollständigt!\\c\\nPrüfe am besten noch mal genau die Habitate im\\nPokédex und nimm an Raids in den Kristallgrotten\\r\\nteil. Du schaffst das, [VAR 0x0100(0000)]![VAR 0x0114(002A)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 67,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 166,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 193,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0100",
          "args_hex": [
            "0000"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 198,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "002A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 7,
      "label": "s1_sub_010_ecology_07",
      "hash64": "77F2EA74C0CC3187",
      "text": "Moment mal, kann es sein...?\\c\\nIst das etwa ein vollständiger Pokédex?![VAR 0x0114(002A)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 28,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 72,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "002A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 8,
      "label": "s1_sub_010_ecology_08",
      "hash64": "77F2DF74C0CC1ED6",
      "text": "Wow! Wooow! Wie fantastisch! Es stehen wirklich\\nalle Pokémon-Arten aus Kitakami drin!\\r\\nIch bin echt schwer beeindruckt![VAR 0x0114(002A)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 85,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 121,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "002A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 9,
      "label": "s1_sub_010_ecology_09",
      "hash64": "77F2E074C0CC2089",
      "text": "Dank dir ist meine Forschung zu den Pokémon in\\nKitakami im Sauseschritt vorangegangen!\\r\\nSchneller ging’s wirklich nicht![VAR 0x0114(002A)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 86,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 122,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "002A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 10,
      "label": "s1_sub_010_ecology_10",
      "hash64": "77F66D74C0CF45F7",
      "text": "Ach, ich würde dir so gerne eine Kleinigkeit zur\\nFeier deiner Leistung geben. Mal sehen...[VAR 0x0114(002A)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 90,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "002A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 11,
      "label": "s1_sub_010_ecology_11",
      "hash64": "77F66C74C0CF4444",
      "text": "Ah, ich hab’s![VAR 0x0114(002A)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 14,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "002A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 12,
      "label": "s1_sub_010_ecology_25",
      "hash64": "77EC5874C0C6CDC3",
      "text": "Du kriegst ein spezielles, exklusives Souvenir, das\\nich beim Kitakami-Kulturzentrum gekauft habe![VAR 0x0114(002A)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 97,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "002A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 13,
      "label": "s1_sub_010_ecology_12",
      "hash64": "77F66F74C0CF495D",
      "text": "Und würdest du bitte kurz dein Smart-Rotom\\nrausholen?[VAR 0x0114(002A)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 53,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "002A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 14,
      "label": "s1_sub_010_ecology_13",
      "hash64": "77F66E74C0CF47AA",
      "text": "Dann bekommst du auch gleich diese tolle\\nvon Clavel hinzugefügte Urkundenfunktion\\r\\nfür die Pokédex-App.[VAR 0x0114(002A)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 81,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 105,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "002A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 15,
      "label": "s1_sub_010_ecology_14",
      "hash64": "77F66974C0CF3F2B",
      "text": "Sieh mal, du hast eine Nachricht von der Firma\\nerhalten, die die Vervollständigung des Pokédex\\r\\nbeglaubigt.[VAR 0x0114(002A)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 94,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 109,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "002A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 16,
      "label": "s1_sub_010_ecology_15",
      "hash64": "77F66874C0CF3D78",
      "text": "Du hast zwar den Pokédex vervollständigt,\\naber die Exkursion hat gerade erst begonnen.[VAR 0x0114(002A)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 86,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "002A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 17,
      "label": "s1_sub_010_ecology_16",
      "hash64": "77F66B74C0CF4291",
      "text": "Begegne auch weiterhin viiielen Pokémon in\\nKitakami.[VAR 0x0114(002A)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 52,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "002A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 18,
      "label": "s1_sub_010_ecology_17",
      "hash64": "77F66A74C0CF40DE",
      "text": "Was für ein schönes Wetter heute, nicht wahr?\\nEin frischer Start in einen neuen Tag.[VAR 0x0114(002A)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 84,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "002A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 19,
      "label": "s1_sub_010_ecology_18",
      "hash64": "77F66574C0CF385F",
      "text": "Die Sommer in Kitakami sind drückend heiß.\\nIch bin in meinem Kittel ganz durchgeschwitzt.[VAR 0x0114(002A)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 89,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "002A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 20,
      "label": "s1_sub_010_ecology_19",
      "hash64": "77F66474C0CF36AC",
      "text": "Die Sonnenuntergänge in Kitakami sind viel\\ndezenter als die in Paldea.\\c\\nVielleicht bricht sich das Licht hier irgendwie\\nanders... Faszinierend.[VAR 0x0114(002A)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 70,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 145,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "002A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 21,
      "label": "s1_sub_010_ecology_20",
      "hash64": "77EC5B74C0C6D2DC",
      "text": "Du bist ja sogar spät noch fleißig am Werk.\\nNimm dir aber auch die Zeit, ab und zu mal in\\r\\nden Himmel zu schauen!\\c\\nVom Dorf geht nur wenig Licht aus, also kann\\nman die Sterne wunderbar sehen.[VAR 0x0114(002A)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 89,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 115,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 195,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "002A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 22,
      "label": "s1_sub_010_ecology_21",
      "hash64": "77EC5C74C0C6D48F",
      "text": "Hach, heute geht’s also mit Regen in den Tag.\\c\\nEs gibt bestimmt einige Pokémon, die sich\\ndarüber freuen![VAR 0x0114(002A)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 45,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 106,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "002A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 23,
      "label": "s1_sub_010_ecology_22",
      "hash64": "77EC5D74C0C6D642",
      "text": "Hier in Kitakami ist die Sommerluft selbst im\\nRegen unheimlich schwül, was für ein Klima!\\c\\nDas wirkt sich auch sicher auf das hiesige\\nÖkosystem aus.[VAR 0x0114(002A)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 89,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 150,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "002A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 24,
      "label": "s1_sub_010_ecology_23",
      "hash64": "77EC5E74C0C6D7F5",
      "text": "Ein verregneter Abend, was? Pass gut auf und\\nerkälte dich nicht.[VAR 0x0114(002A)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 64,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "002A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 25,
      "label": "s1_sub_010_ecology_24",
      "hash64": "77EC5774C0C6CC10",
      "text": "Nachts ist deine Sichtweite stark eingeschränkt\\nund jetzt ist der Boden auch noch schlammig.\\r\\nGeh lieber nicht allzu weit raus.[VAR 0x0114(002A)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 92,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 129,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "002A"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 26,
      "label": "s1_sub_010_ecology_stop",
      "hash64": "476DB22077BD9036",
      "text": "Versuche, 200 verschiedene Pokémon-Arten\\nin deinem Kitakami-Pokédex zu registrieren!\\c\\nSobald du das vollbracht hast, drücke in deiner\\nPokédex-App den [VAR 0xFF00(0006)]X-Knopf[VAR 0xFF00(0000)], um deinen Erfolg\\r\\ndort zu erfassen.\\c\\nKomm anschließend bitte zu mir, damit ich deine\\nLeistung mit eigenen Augen begutachten kann.[VAR 0x0114(002A)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 84,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 152,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "FF00",
          "args_hex": [
            "0006"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 163,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "FF00",
          "args_hex": [
            "0000"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 185,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 206,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE01",
          "args_hex": []
